    <briefdescription>
<para>A single cross-reference extracted from a legal text. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents a reference from one provision to another provision (within the same law, a different German law, or an EU directive).</para>
<para>Examples:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>§ 4 Abs. 1 → same-document reference</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>BImSchG § 4 → inter-law reference</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Richtlinie 2010/75/EU → EU directive reference </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
